    "custom_faq_eBCHJL": {
      "type": "custom-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_nPDmXF": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "General Queries",
            "answer": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_UUjbaL": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do details get transmitted through the website?",
            "answer": "<p>Payment details are transmitted through a company called SecurePay that specialises in secure payment transactions. They use the latest technology available to ensure, as far as practicable, that your information is safe from fraudulent activity.</p><p>Full details of SecurePay can be found at their website of&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.securepay.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.securepay.com.au/</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_A6NAWT": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who can I contact if I am having problems using the site?",
            "answer": "<p>If you have difficulty using or viewing this site, please contact us as we'd like to help.</p><p>We are most interested in what browser and computer you are using and also the nature of the problem if you can have these ready for us it would be helpful.</p><p>We can be contacted by phone, via our feedback form or via the lightning bold message option.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6mirpR": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Payment Method",
            "answer": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_CUiigy": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What payment methods can be used to purchase a My Teddy?",
            "answer": "<p>We accept Visa, MasterCard, AMEX, Paypal, bank deposit, Pay by phone and <a href=\"https://www.afterpay.com.au/buy-with-afterpay/\">AfterPay</a>.</p><p>With bank deposit, it can take 2 business days to clear.  We start work on your teddy when your payment clears.  </p><p>If you would prefer not to pay over the internet, select Pay by Phone as an option at check out, and give us a call to finalise.  Our contact details will be sent to you.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.afterpay.com.au/buy-with-afterpay/\">AfterPay</a> is a buy now pay later credit option.  You may purchase with us using this method, if you have an Afterpay account.</p><p>Contact us if you have any problems at <a href=\"mailto:yourgift@myteddy.com.au\">yourgift@myteddy.com.au</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_BERzUL": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it safe to use credit cards through the online shop?",
            "answer": "<p>We have used the latest secure, encryption services to ensure, as far as practicable, that your shopping with us is as safe as can be. Our server security is constantly monitored and updated to remain compliant to <a href=\"https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/organization_info/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">PCI-DSS</a> requirements.</p><p>My Teddy do not see or retain any credit card details when you use our online facility. This information is passed between yourself and our merchant bank in encrypted form.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_8z7pY4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping",
            "answer": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_UYLgcc": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my My Teddy be received?",
            "answer": "<p>It depends on the shipping that you choose at checkout from us sending. Within Aus we offer Express Post or Registered Post. From sending, Express is 1-2 business days from sending. Registered is around 1 week East Coast, a bit longer for Vic/ TAS/ SA and can be 2 weeks plus for WA / NT. We strive to make and send as soon as possible but depends on a few factors. We send your draft for approval within a couple of business days but if you don't respond we can't make it. Check your junk folder. Once approved, we generally make and send within a couple of business days. These timeframes change depending on the time of year. For example leading up to Easter and Christmas we get really busy and may extend a couple of days. For outside Aus we only send 'pack and track'. NZ is about 1-2 weeks and further away longer. Contact if would like specifics. Please note once we post, it is out of our hands and we do not guarantee timeframes as not in our control.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6KFhJG": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the Shipping Costs?",
            "answer": "<p>Registered Parcel $10.90</p><p>Express Post $16.90</p><p>Please note that this is the method of shipping only, and does not speed up processing and production times.  </p><p>If you would like to speed up your processing (jump the queue as such). Please add Rush order at $22.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_UmUEpi": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the Processing Times?",
            "answer": "<p>Processing time depends on how busy we are, and our workload.  We aim to be as quick as possible.<br/><br/>We work through each personalised item in the order that it was recieved, so can't guarantee a time that your order will arrive.  <br/><br/>If you would like to speed things up, you can choose our Rush My Order option, which is $22. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_TPUAtD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Rush My Order?",
            "answer": "<p>If you would like your order to be prioritised, you might like to use the Rush My Order option.  </p><p>This will put your order to proirity processing and design, to get your order out as soon as possible.  Please note that Rush order is not relevent to your shipping method.  If you want to recieve your order in the fastest possible time frame.  Please also select express post. Remembering for outside Aus there is no Express option.</p><p>Keep in mind that we cant rush any order unless you have approved the design first. We also don't despatch on Saturday or Sunday.</p><p> Hit the lighting bolt symbol if you have any questions. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_J4fEj9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I send to hospitals, PO Boxes, work places etc?",
            "answer": "<p>We use Australia Post to send our personalised Teddies, bunnies and plushies, so you can post to any address, including Parcel Locker, home, business, hospital, PO Box</p><p>With delivery to hospitals, allow a little extra time for the hospital to process the parcel internally.</p><p>Allow for the fact the Australia Post don't deliver on weekends.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_ELfUef": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I send a My Teddy bear overseas?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely, we send our teddy bears to a lot of countries around the world.</p><p>Please check the drop down box to see if the country you would like to send to is there.</p><p>Please note since Brexit we no longer can send to the UK as they have imposed a 20% VAT on the entire price whuch must be collected and paid for in advance of sending orpaid by the recipient.</p><p>Similarly the European Union (EU) have imposed the same at 21% since July 1 2021 so we will no longer send to the EU.</p><p>As of May 2025 due to severe insurance changes we can no longer send to the USA.</p><p>Delivery times around the world will vary, so please allow between 2 - 8 weeks for delivery depending on the destination. This will change over time as free trade agreements are established, stay tuned.</p><h5><br/>International Couriers</h5><p>Auckland is generally around 4 business days from dispatch and depending on how remote, allow for about a week to 10 days to other NZ destinations. Aus Post advise officially to allow up to 12 business days from sending, and can be longer in busy times.</p><h5>International Couriers</h5><p>If you need to arrive really quickly there are options like Air Mail Express Post, Fedex and TNT. They can be pricey, we encourage you to get a quote and arrange this type of service, we're happy for them to collect from us.  We don't work with couriers or get quotes, but if you would like to arrange that, we are happy to have them collect from us.  Please contact us to discuss.</p><p>Finally, we are obliged to advise that there are NO export restrictions on sending overseas, as confirmed with the Australian Customs Service.</p><p>Some countries charge duty on incoming goods over a certain amount (eg in Australia this is $1000). We do mark our parcels as gifts for customs purposes.  They shouldn't incur any customs charges, but we cannot absolutely promise as is out of our control.</p><p>A good link to look at to assist with the destination countries requirements is <a href=\"http://auspost.com.au/apps/international-post-guide.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://auspost.com.au/apps/international-post-guide.html</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_niNpb4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my teddy bear be changed once I have completed the order?",
            "answer": "<p>We endeavour to get your order going asap, so, should you need to change anything, email us immediately using the confirmation that you were sent via email.  If you haven't got it, please check your junk folder. </p><p>If we haven't started your embroidery, changes can be made easily.  </p><p>So remember – CHECK, DOUBLE CHECK and TRIPLE CHECK – the details.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
